WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
It was a student protest.

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:10.780
I was working on the campus in that building, and I was standing in the front of that building when the sheriff’s deputies lined up.

3
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:11.860
I don’t remember how many.

4
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.177
It may have been thirty, forty, fifty; I don’t remember.

5
00:00:13.177 --> 00:00:18.900
But they all lined up and then they were standing in front of the kids and they pointed their rifles.

6
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:26.940
I was standing right on that corner, and then all of a sudden, gun shots were fired and tear gas was fired.

7
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.400
Folks just went running.

8
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.060
We could see the two students laying on the ground, and they laid there some time.

9
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:41.140
I don’t know if they could have been saved or not, but had they maybe been given immediate attention, they may have survived.
